{"aspect_id":"cleanliness","definition":"判断评论描述的餐厅、桌面、餐具或卫生间清洁程度。高分只表示更干净，低分只表示更脏。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"非常脏或不卫生，存在严重、具体的卫生问题","1":"比较脏，桌面、地面、餐具或卫生间有明显问题","2":"清洁程度一般、不同区域表现不一或处于普通水平","3":"比较干净，主要区域维护良好","4":"非常干净整洁，各区域卫生状况都很出色"},"special_rules":["装修陈旧不等于不干净，装修漂亮也不等于卫生良好。","只评价评论明确描述的卫生和清洁情况。"],"review_text":"The servers are indifferent, unprofessional, robotic and often just plain slovenly and this extends to the chef/line cooks and the over priced food that comes out of the kitchen.

Dee, my vegetarian friend/transcriptionist, insisted I try the South Philly location as her guest and after stepping in and looking around the first time, I refused to eat here because it looked cramped, dirty and down at the heels. Dee was annoyed and said, "This place looks like your house so why are you being so snotty?" I reminded her that while I did like displaying my china and tea pot collections, my house was always spotless and S. Philly Sabrina's did not appear to be. 

While many items on the menu *sound* unusual and out of the ordinary, Sabrina's is pretty much an eggs, waffle, pancake and breakfast meat place and they do nothing with any of these standards that are in the least memorable."}

{"aspect_id":"cleanliness","definition":"判断评论描述的餐厅、桌面、餐具或卫生间清洁程度。高分只表示更干净，低分只表示更脏。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"非常脏或不卫生，存在严重、具体的卫生问题","1":"比较脏，桌面、地面、餐具或卫生间有明显问题","2":"清洁程度一般、不同区域表现不一或处于普通水平","3":"比较干净，主要区域维护良好","4":"非常干净整洁，各区域卫生状况都很出色"},"special_rules":["装修陈旧不等于不干净，装修漂亮也不等于卫生良好。","只评价评论明确描述的卫生和清洁情况。"],"review_text":"The outdoor area was also neat as it was very clean and had multiple heaters at each table so we didn't feel cold. Side note, the bathrooms are very clean and well maintained. 

Pro Tips:
Ample parking. You could either park in their dedicated lot, park at Target, or park for free on 5th street before the loading zone."}

{"aspect_id":"crowded","definition":"判断评论描述的店内拥挤程度。高分只表示更拥挤，低分只表示更空旷或人更少。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"完全不拥挤，人很少且空间非常宽松","1":"不太拥挤，座位和活动空间比较充足","2":"拥挤程度一般、随时段变化或好坏混合","3":"比较拥挤，人多、座位紧张或空间局促","4":"非常拥挤，店内爆满、极度局促或几乎无法活动"},"special_rules":["排队时间和店内拥挤是两个不同特征。","只说等了很久不能直接判定店内拥挤。"],"review_text":"We were on the 8th floor in a luxury room and the view was gorgeous! We were looking right out into the city. Our room was very spacious and had plenty of storage for clothes and shoes. Room has an iron and two bathrobes, as well as a hair dryer. Of course body washes are there waiting. The shower was great! Not tiny and had different levels of pressure from the shower head. Bathroom was also nice and spacious. 

The room wasn't over the top luxurious. It was just right. It was very spacious and comfortable. Bed was cozy and comfy beyond belief. Usually after hotel stays I can't wait to get to my bed. No way. I didn't want to leave the Loews. 

From morning till early evening there are free and fresh refreshments in the lobby. That was always a nice treat after a full day of adventures. The hotel also smells soooo good and fresh."}

{"aspect_id":"crowded","definition":"判断评论描述的店内拥挤程度。高分只表示更拥挤，低分只表示更空旷或人更少。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"完全不拥挤，人很少且空间非常宽松","1":"不太拥挤，座位和活动空间比较充足","2":"拥挤程度一般、随时段变化或好坏混合","3":"比较拥挤，人多、座位紧张或空间局促","4":"非常拥挤，店内爆满、极度局促或几乎无法活动"},"special_rules":["排队时间和店内拥挤是两个不同特征。","只说等了很久不能直接判定店内拥挤。"],"review_text":"Green Eggs Cafe in South Philly is awesome--one of two places I am willing to go to despite being cash only.  For some reason, that awesomeness did not translate to the 13th street location. The space itself is less welcoming and the staff kind of meh. The bare walls and ceiling mean it is very noisey.

Even the food doesn't seem as good or consistent as South Philly. For better or worse they are a short walk from work and if I want eggs, the food is better than IHOP, but the service far worse. But I've yet to leave here being particularly happy with my meal.

The waitstaff work hard, but don't seem to have enough time to be attentive--water not refilled once, didn't ask if my food was good after it was delivered. Watching the hostess stand bored, picking her teeth with her thumbnail, while I have been without water for half my meal and could really use a check may be the last straw."}

{"aspect_id":"crowded","definition":"判断评论描述的店内拥挤程度。高分只表示更拥挤，低分只表示更空旷或人更少。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"完全不拥挤，人很少且空间非常宽松","1":"不太拥挤，座位和活动空间比较充足","2":"拥挤程度一般、随时段变化或好坏混合","3":"比较拥挤，人多、座位紧张或空间局促","4":"非常拥挤，店内爆满、极度局促或几乎无法活动"},"special_rules":["排队时间和店内拥挤是两个不同特征。","只说等了很久不能直接判定店内拥挤。"],"review_text":"My boyfriend and I went to Lee How Fook after purchasing a Groupon. Let's just say that the experience was so terrible that we considered leaving without even using it.

We entered the restaurant and were not even acknowledged by the staff although they clearly saw us waiting. We sat ourselves after a server motioned to an open table. We were never provided with menus, so I had to get them myself. We then had to practically beg for water. I asked for tea, but we never received it.

Our table was located close to the entrance. Groups of people continued to arrive at the restaurant who had made reservations; however, there were no tables available for them. In one instance, a group with a reservation for 6:00 was not sat until 6:40. Other people without reservations walked in and sat down at tables ahead of those already waiting."}

{"aspect_id":"date_suitable","definition":"判断评论描述的商家是否适合情侣约会或纪念日。高分只表示更适合约会，低分只表示更不适合。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"非常不适合约会，环境或体验明显破坏约会氛围","1":"比较不适合约会，缺乏私密感、舒适感或浪漫感","2":"约会适合度一般、好坏混合或取决于具体时段位置","3":"比较适合约会，氛围舒适并有一定浪漫感","4":"非常适合约会或纪念日，氛围、私密感和体验都很突出"},"special_rules":["只说装修好看但没有约会相关信息时，只能视为间接证据。","明确的约会、纪念日或情侣实际体验优先于泛泛的氛围描述。"],"review_text":"The overall aesthetic here is quite lovely, fun and  welcoming. Very thought out details and many different seating areas. There's a bar with a super cool reclaimed looking wood tap, tufted cozy booths with exposed bricks behind. Casual  picnic tables, romantic two tops and my favorite, a lounge type area with mixed matched furniture with various vintage like frames, mirrors and local art. Very cool! 

I believe Bar Hygee is a great option for anyone and at any time. It's very versatile! Date night, brunch with the entire fam, happy hour with specials for young professionals, late night post-concert or game snacks, tasty din, meeting up with friends for drinks! It's really a great option...period. 

You're definitely going to want to go ahead and try one their house-brewed beers. After sampling a few, the 'Grooving Grinds' remains a lighter favorite for us."}

{"aspect_id":"date_suitable","definition":"判断评论描述的商家是否适合情侣约会或纪念日。高分只表示更适合约会，低分只表示更不适合。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"非常不适合约会，环境或体验明显破坏约会氛围","1":"比较不适合约会，缺乏私密感、舒适感或浪漫感","2":"约会适合度一般、好坏混合或取决于具体时段位置","3":"比较适合约会，氛围舒适并有一定浪漫感","4":"非常适合约会或纪念日，氛围、私密感和体验都很突出"},"special_rules":["只说装修好看但没有约会相关信息时，只能视为间接证据。","明确的约会、纪念日或情侣实际体验优先于泛泛的氛围描述。"],"review_text":"My husband and I had such a nice date night at Miss Rachel's Pantry. The decor of the intimate restaurant was really adorable! Tiny tea lights twinkled throughout, making the perfect romantic dinner place.

The entire experience lasted about 2 hours and the pace of the meal was spot on. We never felt rushed - maybe because they didn't have to turn tables - which was great. Each course was delicious and a good size. I was worried from photos that the portions would be too tiny and we would be hungry. I left SO full! The dessert put me over the edge but that was my favorite part. 

I'm not sure we would go back - kind of a one and done in my opinion. But I loved my time there!"}

{"aspect_id":"date_suitable","definition":"判断评论描述的商家是否适合情侣约会或纪念日。高分只表示更适合约会，低分只表示更不适合。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"非常不适合约会，环境或体验明显破坏约会氛围","1":"比较不适合约会，缺乏私密感、舒适感或浪漫感","2":"约会适合度一般、好坏混合或取决于具体时段位置","3":"比较适合约会，氛围舒适并有一定浪漫感","4":"非常适合约会或纪念日，氛围、私密感和体验都很突出"},"special_rules":["只说装修好看但没有约会相关信息时，只能视为间接证据。","明确的约会、纪念日或情侣实际体验优先于泛泛的氛围描述。"],"review_text":"Such a cozy, local neighborhood BYOB spot serving AMAZING new American food. One of my new Philly favorites, especially for a date night or a small group of friends. I came in with my boyfriend for dinner, and loved the experience & food. We'll be back!

Atmosphere: Seats 26 people in total, and feels super intimate. The servers were so friendly. My only slight complaint is that the tables are quite close to each other, so you're bound to overhear neighboring conversations. That being said, still a great spot for date night. Dress code is generally on the nicer side, but you can dress down too. The fact that it's BYOB is amazing as well.

Food: Everything we ordered was amazing! I loved the butter they served with the bread - a bit of truffle mixed in, and a hint of sweetness."}

{"aspect_id":"food_quality","definition":"判断评论描述的菜品整体质量。高分只表示菜品质量更好，低分只表示菜品质量更差。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"菜品质量很差，明显难吃、不新鲜或烹饪严重失当","1":"菜品质量偏差，存在比较明显的问题","2":"菜品质量一般、好坏混合或处于普通水平","3":"菜品质量较好，好吃、新鲜或烹饪得当","4":"菜品质量非常出色，并有强烈、具体的高度评价"},"special_rules":["只评价评论实际描述的菜品质量，不根据餐厅类别推测。","评论描述多个菜品且质量不同时，根据整体描述判断；无法形成明显整体倾向时使用中间等级。"],"review_text":"The restaurant itself is pretty nice.  The staff was friendly, if not overly attentive.

The orange beef was very tasty.  The chicken and peas was very bland, and all the vegetables just tasted like they came out of a freezer bag.

Nothing I had was "nasty" but nothing was worth going back for, either.  I've enjoyed Chinese buffets more than this."}

{"aspect_id":"food_quality","definition":"判断评论描述的菜品整体质量。高分只表示菜品质量更好，低分只表示菜品质量更差。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"菜品质量很差，明显难吃、不新鲜或烹饪严重失当","1":"菜品质量偏差，存在比较明显的问题","2":"菜品质量一般、好坏混合或处于普通水平","3":"菜品质量较好，好吃、新鲜或烹饪得当","4":"菜品质量非常出色，并有强烈、具体的高度评价"},"special_rules":["只评价评论实际描述的菜品质量，不根据餐厅类别推测。","评论描述多个菜品且质量不同时，根据整体描述判断；无法形成明显整体倾向时使用中间等级。"],"review_text":"My wife and I recently dined at Buddakan to celebrate our anniversary. Needless to say, with all the great reviews on Yelp, which we normally find agreeable, our expectations were quite high for a great meal. Unfortunately, we were quite disappointed.  The  tuna spring rolls and the chicken dumplings.  The spring rolls and dumplings were bland and for that matter nothing was very tasty or flavorful.  
My wife was disappointed with meal as well. The steak was properly cooked medium but was dry and tasteless. There was just a small hint of Wasabi flavor.  

I don't understand what all the positive comments are about"}

{"aspect_id":"group_suitable","definition":"判断评论描述的商家是否适合多人或大型聚餐。高分只表示更适合多人聚餐，低分只表示更不适合。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"非常不适合多人聚餐，明确无法接待或团体体验很差","1":"比较不适合多人聚餐，空间、座位或服务限制明显","2":"多人聚餐适合度一般、人数受限或存在明显条件","3":"比较适合多人聚餐，空间和接待能力较好","4":"非常适合大型聚餐，拥有充足空间、合适座位和成熟接待能力"},"special_rules":["只说餐厅拥挤不能直接判定是否适合多人聚餐。","明确的团体人数、座位安排和接待体验是主要判断依据。"],"review_text":"I dig this place. I don't remember the last time I actually saw pizza samples outside of a market or wholesaler. There's a good amount of seating (but cramped), the bathroom was clean, there were TV(s), and the soda fountains are on the outside so I enjoyed the ambiance.

So I got a small steak stromboli which for the price was a great value. It was bigger than I thought it would be and came out on a pan (since I dined in). Loved the taste and I think they even had real knives and forks. I hope I'm not confusing this place with another. I hate cutting stromboli with those flimsy plastic joints. 

I will say this... as much as I loved it... it upset my stomach later on. I don't know if it was something I ate earlier that didn't mesh or if it was an overdose of cheese (it was quite cheesy..."}

{"aspect_id":"group_suitable","definition":"判断评论描述的商家是否适合多人或大型聚餐。高分只表示更适合多人聚餐，低分只表示更不适合。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"非常不适合多人聚餐，明确无法接待或团体体验很差","1":"比较不适合多人聚餐，空间、座位或服务限制明显","2":"多人聚餐适合度一般、人数受限或存在明显条件","3":"比较适合多人聚餐，空间和接待能力较好","4":"非常适合大型聚餐，拥有充足空间、合适座位和成熟接待能力"},"special_rules":["只说餐厅拥挤不能直接判定是否适合多人聚餐。","明确的团体人数、座位安排和接待体验是主要判断依据。"],"review_text":"If you're concerned about overcooking or undercooking your food don't be...the waitress was helpful and it is pretty apparent when the food is done cooking. This place did not disappoint and I would definitely go back again. 

The only suggestion I would have is for management to incorporate a way for large groups to have separate checks identified up front. At the end of our meal the waitress manually wrote out separate checks which was time consuming and bit awkward. It would have been nice to have the separate checks per couple broken down especially since this is a place where large groups of people are likely to meet up for dinner. I was surprised that it wasn't already a part of the process. 

Great food! Good experience!"}

{"aspect_id":"parking","definition":"判断评论描述的停车便利程度。高分只表示停车更方便，低分只表示停车更困难。","relevance_scale":{"0":"评论没有谈到该特征","1":"只能从评论中间接、勉强推测该特征","2":"评论明确谈到该特征，但描述较短或上下文有限","3":"评论明确谈到该特征，并提供了清楚、充分的描述"},"strength_scale":{"0":"停车非常困难，没有可用车位或几乎无法停车","1":"停车比较困难，车位少、费用高或需要找很久","2":"停车便利度一般、取决于时段或存在明显条件","3":"停车比较方便，通常能找到合适车位","4":"停车非常方便，有充足、免费或专用车位"},"special_rules":["公共交通方便不能直接判定停车方便。","只描述餐厅位置但没有车位信息时不能明确判断停车便利度。"],"review_text":"With the original Chart House and the first ones to follow, they were considered the place to go for great seafood!  They are all in locations near the water. This one is located in Penn's Landing, with a good sized free parking lot or front door valet parking. This is the only Chart House in Pennsylvania.

When you first walk in you are met on the central level of this restaurant.  Walking down the stairs will bring you into a large open feeling and welcoming bar and lounge with massive seating at tables or at the bar.  You will experience waterfront views and a more relaxed and casual dining experience than the patrons sitting two stories above.  I have done both several times, both are as eloquent as the other, but the lounge is more relaxed.

I come here for the clam chowder which is award winning and very good as is the lobster bisque, which is laced with sherry."}

